    {
        "content": "<p>maybe i should use something like this <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/Mathlib/Data/Set/Card.html#Set.Finite.encard_eq_coe_toFinset_card\">Set.Finite.encard_eq_coe_toFinset_card</a></p>",
